export anchor BorderWidth:
    description:
        Sets the thickness of the component's borders. One value sets all sides; two set top/bottom then left/right; three set top, left/right, bottom; four set top, right, bottom, left. A border is only drawn when its style is not none.

    identifier: borderWidth

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `border-width` property.

    values:
        - `<length>`
        - `<top> <right>? <bottom>? <left>?`

    initial: 0

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            borderWidth: 2px
        \\\
        ```
